<title>INDIA: Port conditions update - India/Pakistan (LLOYDS).</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - India/Pakistan (LLOYDS).</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>INDIA -</p>
<p>BOMBAY, Feb 27 -  Thirty-two vessels berthed alongside, 20 vessels anchored off Bombay floating light, awaiting orders regarding next employment. No delay at Bombay port.</p>
<p>JAWAHARLAL NEHRU - Delay for container vessels two to three days and for bulk cargo vessels five to six days.</p>
<p>PAKISTAN -</p>
<p>KARACHI, March 4 - Eight vessels waiting off port, six fertiliser vessels, the first waiting 15 days, and two oil tankers, the first waiting eight days. Four vessels waiting off port for their own reasons.</p>
</text>
